WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.800
Step 1.

00:00:01.750 --> 00:00:08.700
The PBO published a cost estimate in October 2020 — before Parliament voted to expand MAID.

00:00:08.700 --> 00:00:14.625
The finding: MAID saves the healthcare system 149 million dollars per year.

00:00:14.625 --> 00:00:20.475
Projected savings by 2047: 1.273 trillion dollars.

00:00:20.475 --> 00:00:25.300
This document was available to every MP before the C-7 vote.
